# Phase 1 baseline style (Task T004) - Refer to docs/code_style.md for rationale
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 2
TabWidth: 2
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 120
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
PointerAlignment: Left
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
SortIncludes: true
NamespaceIndentation: None
